{
  "overview": "A starter template combining NestJS with Prisma as the ORM and a code-first GraphQL API layer via Apollo, rather than a REST API. It provides authentication scaffolding on top of a Prisma-backed schema, intended as a base for GraphQL-first NestJS services.",
